Format disk:

`# sudo blkdiscard -f /dev/nvme0n1`

Set up partitions:

`# parted /dev/nvme0n1 -- mklabel gpt`
`# parted /dev/nvme0n1 -- mkpart root ext4 512MB -32GB`
* 32GB chosen for swap here; for hibernate, you'll want at least 1.5x your RAM
`# parted /dev/nvme0n1 -- mkpart swap linux-swap -32GB 100%`
`# parted /dev/nvme0n1 -- mkpart ESP fat32 1MB 512MB`
`# parted /dev/nvme0n1 -- set 3 esp on`

Set up LUKS for main partition and swap:

`# cryptsetup luksFormat /dev/nvme0n1p1` (choose password)
`# cryptsetup luksFormat /dev/nvme0n1p2` (choose password)
`# cryptsetup luksOpen /dev/nvme0n1p1 nixos-crypt`
`# cryptsetup luksOpen /dev/nvme0n1p2 swap-crypt`

Make filesystems:

`# mkfs.ext4 -L nixos /dev/mapper/nixos-crypt`
`# mkswap -L swap /dev/mapper/swap-crypt`
`# mkfs.fat -F 32 -n boot /dev/nvme0n1p3`

(note that the nixos + swap + boot labels here allow nicer hardware config)

Mount:

`# mkdir /mnt`
`# mount /dev/disk/by-label/nixos /mnt`
`# mkdir /mnt/boot`
`# mount -o umask=077 /dev/disk/by-label/boot /mnt/boot`

Configure:

`# mkdir /mnt/etc`
`# cp -r /etc/nixos /mnt/etc/`
`# nixos-generate-config --root /mnt`
`sudo -e /mnt/etc/nixos/hardware-configuration.nix`
* add:
  ```
  swapDevices = [{
    # UUID of the LUKS container `swap-crypt`
    # Find with `ls -l /dev/mapper/swap-crypt` and `ls -l /dev/disk/by-uuid`
    device = "/dev/disk/by-uuid/4270da97-acde-46ad-b26c-4282741e6067";
    encrypted = {
      enable = true;
      label = "swap";
      # UUID of the partition `/dev/nvme0n1p2` containing the LUKS container `swap-crypt`
      # Find with `ls -l /dev/disk/by-uuid`
      blkDev = "/dev/disk/by-uuid/8a907990-0cfd-42b9-b724-f8e3353e7398";
    };
  }];
  ```
* feel free to replace `nixos-crypt` with `nixos` for cleanliness
`# nixos-install --flake '/mnt/etc/nixos#casper`

Reboot:

`# shutdown -r now`
(login to root using previously-set password)
`# passwd hemant`
`# exit`
(login to hemant)
`# nixos-rebuild switch`
`# shutdown -r now`
(the prior two steps set up home-manager; nixos-install doesn't appear to do so)
